WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.409 --> 00:00:05.529
Afraid to go in?

00:00:05.529 --> 00:00:08.870
Exploration always carries risk.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:16.080
I say we risk it.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.080
Take us in.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.170
Aye, sir.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:21.710
A toast.

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:25.670
Union service is just as much about mundane
busy work

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:26.679
as it is about adventure.

00:00:26.679 --> 00:00:27.890
Where are we going?

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:29.460
What the hell?

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.030
Good morning, Commander.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:32.599
Good morning, Lieutenant.

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:34.690
You're an interesting species.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.500
You know how to fly one of these things?

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:42.790
We're about to find out.

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:52.329
I now command the full might of Krill.

00:00:52.329 --> 00:00:57.130
Just wipe them off the face of the galaxy.

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:59.260
Let me shoot you.

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:00.879
You could feel

00:01:00.879 --> 00:01:04.059
joy, happiness, affection, love.

00:01:04.059 --> 00:01:09.380
I can have your heart or your soul.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:11.050
Show the galaxy that humans are different!

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:15.750
That we value life, even when our enemies
don't!

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:18.440
Go!

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:25.140
Just hit the button

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:29.790
before you hit the ground.

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:31.640
Good luck.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.172
If you do the right thing

00:01:33.172 --> 00:01:42.020
in the here and now,

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:55.360
the future has a way of taking care of itself.

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:58.470
Hooray!

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:01.590
Hooray!

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:04.700
Enough!

